OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear spells
OL,6,Fdeveloping for a time tonight, before
OL,7,Fclouding over from the west, with some
OL,8,Fshowery outbreaks of rain arriving
OL,9,Flater on. Heavy bursts of rain are
OL,10,Fpossible by the morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FShowery rain will move through
OL,13,Fduring the morning, locally on the
OL,14,Fheavy side. This will be followed by a
OL,15,Flargely dry and brighter afternoon.
OL,16,FBreezy, though feeling warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
