OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FUnsettled at first with spells of
OL,7,Fheavy rain at times and strong winds.
OL,8,FSettling down on Wednesday with spells
OL,9,Fof sunshine, and temperatures around
OL,10,Fthe seasonal average.
